WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.680
I am Selenia, Faye's sister.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:08.960
The smarter, older, and more responsible

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.280
and more successful sister.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.440
But, as much as she annoys me, I have to

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.040
respect her drive.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:20.560
My sister, Faye,

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:25.040
she was very, very rude and took you off

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.440
my ship

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:28.000
originally

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.800
when I first captured you.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.720
She took you

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.240
and

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:36.000
she told me,

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.640
"Humans, they have rights, too."

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.400
So, so I suppose I'll let her play her

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.000
little fantasy world where everyone is

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.320
friends and the humans won't try to

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.040
destroy us

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:54.000
and we won't hurt the humans.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.880
She's become really attached to you and

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:02.880
she keeps going down to visit you.
